          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"initial-color-convention\">Initial color convention</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The physical top width averages its initial color, so the final bottom-color sum gives an overall factor one. The gallery sums initial colors and therefore has an extra factor three. Both choices use <code>Particle.color_sum</code>; the calculation proves their ratio exactly. W decays have no initial color, so both choices coincide.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The squared amplitudes and widths of each charge-conjugate pair agree for generic <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(V_R,V_I||)</marimo-tex>, with dependence only on <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(|V|^2=V_R^2+V_I^2||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
